<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">What this digest covers</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Agents are moving from demos into infrastructure: protocols that connect them to tools, security guidance, containment tools, regulatory attention and new ways to charge for them. This report summarises what published sources said on those topics between mid-2025 and October 2026.
  </p>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    It is a digest, not original research. Figures come from the sources listed at the end, and many are vendors’ own claims. We mark our own readings as ours. Our case-study results are not used here as evidence about the market.
  </p>
</div>

